meta {
  name: QA0 - Event Format Enum + Immutability
  seq: 2
}

docs {
  QA0 ships public.event_format ('quiz' | 'judged') and prevent_event_format_change(), a BEFORE UPDATE trigger bound to events (in the now-skipped QA1 schema migration) that rejects any change to events.format once set. This is a pure schema/constraint ticket with no RPC or standalone endpoint to call — it is exercised implicitly every time the "Create Event" request (T6 folder) sets format='quiz' at insert, and would reject a PATCH that tried to change it afterward. No runtime request is included here by design.
}
